Illumineaux (mudmail):
  When I moved away from my hometown, my best friend and I wanted an
  inexpensive way to chat without being on the phone and racking up
  long distance charges.  So of course we would chat on ICQ.  Then we had
  this idea...Wouldnt it be great if we could play a game and chat at the
  same time!  A mutual friend of ours, who happened to a be computer geek,
  was telling us about these relatively new games on the internet called
  multi user dungeons.  So we searched somehow and came across NannyMud.
  I think we chose NannyMud becuase it sounded the least scary of all
  the others muds we came across. That is when my first charachter Ravenskye
  was created.
  
